      "academic_org": "Dept of Linguistics & Mod Lang",
      "learning_outcomes": "Upon completion of the course, the student should be able to deal with some simple daily situations in German such as\n- Shopping in a supermarket\n- Talking about family and relatives\n- Discussing daily routines and leisure activities\n- Giving/receiving directions and telling time",
